  -H 'Idempotency-Key: exemplu-programAttemptSubmit-001' \
  --cookie "$OPENALIMENT_COOKIE_FILE" \
  --cookie-jar "$OPENALIMENT_COOKIE_FILE" \
  -H 'Content-Type: application/json' \
  --data '{}'
```

